    "creative": "The semi gantry ad, 'One side of your plant has structure. The other does not,' brought 175 messages at $45.00 MXN. The hydraulic stacker carousel, which opens the chat with a ready-made quote request, brought 79 at $49.17. The electric winch carousel brought 74 at $60.72, and the electric hoist ad, which opens on efficiency and safety, brought 90 at $84.12. Worth testing a hoist ad that opens on a plant problem, since the problem-first semi gantry opening keeps the lowest cost.",
